 "description": "This is the life the all-new Aquila 46 Yacht power catamaran  is made for: long-range escapes, effortless entertaining, and those rare moments when comfort, capability, and beauty converge.\nThe Aquila 46 Yacht features the same \"Explorer\" aesthetic as our head-turning 50 Yacht‚ designed for those who want larger yacht innovation in a more intimate package. The impressive 23'3\" beam creates interior volume that feels remarkably spacious, while thoughtful design maximizes every inch for privacy and connection. CE category A ocean certification means confident open-water exploration with serious offshore capability.\nStep aboard and discover expansive outdoor areas with stylish lounges and integrated gathering zones perfect for entertaining. The open-concept interior features panoramic windows that flood the salon with natural light and ocean views, creating a spacious living area with full galley accompanied with household sized refrigeration and induction cooktop. The rear salon window and sliding main entrance door opens to create seamless indoor/outdoor entertainment space that enhances every gathering.\nAvailable with multiple cabin configurations, plus options like the Aquila Hydro Glide ® foil system and interior helm‚ this yacht adapts perfectly to your cruising lifestyle.\nBecause out there, wonder awaits.",
